{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52212","headline":"颂六十二首 三十七 · 道世","name":"颂六十二首 三十七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金躯遗散骨，宝塔徧天龙。\n创开於十塔，终成八万兴。\n珠盖灵光变，刹柱吐芙蓉。\n屡开朝雾露，数示晓灵徵。\n红霓相映发，风摇响和钟。\n仙鸾往往见，神僧数数从。\n独超群圣上，合识普生恭。\n砧碓击不碎，方知圣叵穷。\n（见同书卷五三《感福部》）（按：《明州阿育王山志》卷十录此首，题作《颂佛舍利》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"道世","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52212.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52212","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}